      "description": "Compact existing state annotation; not a general label size.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-badge\">Snapshot</span>",
      "css": ".ds-badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:999px;font-family:var(--font-sans,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif);font-size:.7rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.03em;background:var(--color-primary-muted,#f5eaf0);color:var(--color-action,#984064);white-space:nowrap}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Working Panel",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "card",
      "description": "Flat bounded grouping for real operational content.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-panel\"><h3 class=\"ds-panel-title\">Campaign records</h3><p class=\"ds-panel-copy\">Review the records in the current campaign.</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-panel{font-family:var(--font-sans,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif);font-size:14px;line-height:1.5; padding:24px;border:1px solid var(--color-border,#e7e7e2);border-radius:10px;background:var(--color-surface-card,#fff);color:var(--color-on-surface,#242422);box-shadow:none}.ds-panel-title{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:18px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.025em}.ds-panel-copy{margin:0;color:var(--color-on-surface-muted,#60605b)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Creation Disclosure",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Native inline setup disclosure keeps records visible.",
      "html": "<details class=\"ds-create\"><summary class=\"ds-create-summary\"><strong>Create campaign</strong><span class=\"ds-create-description\">Add a campaign when needed</span><svg class=\"ds-create-chevron\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"ds-create-body\">Campaign configuration appears here.</div></details>",
      "css": ".ds-create{font-family:var(--font-sans,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif);font-size:14px;line-height:1.5; border-block:1px solid var(--color-border,#e7e7e2);color:var(--color-on-surface,#242422)}.ds-create-summary{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;min-height:56px;padding:12px 0;list-style:none;cursor:pointer}.ds-create-summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}.ds-create-summary:hover{color:var(--color-action,#984064)}.ds-create-summary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--color-action,#984064);outline-offset:3px;}.ds-create-description{flex:1;font-size:13px;color:var(--color-on-surface-muted,#60605b)}.ds-create[open] .ds-create-chevron{transform:rotate(180deg)}.ds-create-body{padding:8px 0 24px}@media(max-width:639px){.ds-create-summary{flex-wrap:wrap}.ds-create-description{flex-basis:100%;order:4}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Workspace Tab",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "workspace-tab",
      "description": "Linked task workspace with a restrained active underline.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-tabs\" aria-label=\"Email workspaces\"><a class=\"ds-tab\" href=\"#prepare\" aria-current=\"page\">Preparation</a><a class=\"ds-tab\" href=\"#templates\">Templates</a><a class=\"ds-tab\" href=\"#history\">Delivery history</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-tabs{display:flex;gap:24px;overflow-x:auto;border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-border,#e7e7e2)}.ds-tab{font-family:var(--font-sans,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif);font-size:14px;line-height:1.5; display:inline-flex;align-items:center;flex-shrink:0;min-height:48px;padding:8px 0;border-bottom:2px solid transparent;font-weight:500;white-space:nowrap;text-decoration:none;color:var(--color-on-surface-muted,#60605b)}.ds-tab[aria-current]{color:var(--color-on-surface,#242422);border-bottom-color:var(--color-action,#984064)}.ds-tab:hover{color:var(--color-on-surface,#242422)}.ds-tab:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--color-action,#984064);outline-offset:3px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Persistent Tool Launcher",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "widget-launcher",
      "description": "Circular launcher for the persistent phone or quick form.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-launcher\" aria-label=\"Open phone\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 3h4l2 5-3 2a15 15 0 0 0 7 7l2-3 5 2v4c0 1-1 2-2 2C9 21 3 15 2 5c0-1 1-2 2-2Z\"/></svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-launcher{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:48px;height:48px;border:1px solid var(--color-border-strong,#cdcdc6);border-radius:999px;background:var(--color-surface-elevated,#fff);color:var(--color-on-surface,#242422);box-shadow:var(--shadow-2,0 4px 16px rgb(20 20 20 / 4%));cursor:pointer}.ds-launcher:hover{background:var(--color-surface-2,#f7f7f5)}.ds-launcher:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--color-action,#984064);outline-offset:3px;}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Operational Signal Desk",
    "overview": "The authenticated CRM now expresses the incumbent Operational Signal Desk as a **Framed sheet**: labelled neutral navigation and a quiet utility header frame a flat working surface. Campaign context, records, operational status and the next useful action carry the hierarchy. The neutral primary buttons and restrained magenta selection/focus signal support long sessions without turning each screen into a dashboard of decorative cards.\n\nThis is a code-led Operate extension of the established dual-theme system. The default shell opens in light mode and restores an explicitly saved dark preference. Preserve the configured organization name, logo, favicon and accessible alternatives; Laravel CRM remains the default product name. This document describes the authenticated shell and matching sign-in materials. The existing public landing composition remains a separate scoped expression in `resources/css/landing.css`; do not flatten or restyle it through workspace rules.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Flat working sheets framed by role-appropriate navigation.",
      "Dual-theme neutrals with restrained magenta focus and selection.",
      "Sentence-case labels, readable platform sans and tabular operational figures.",
      "Records before setup, with native creation disclosures.",
      "Persistent campaign and call/form context with safe scrolling space.",
      "Visible keyboard focus, contained overflow and reduced-motion support."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The One Signal Rule",
        "body": "Use magenta to identify selection, focus and meaningful operational emphasis; give ordinary actions a neutral hierarchy.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Sentence Case Rule",
        "body": "Use plain task labels and descriptive headings. Do not turn leftover tiny metadata, kickers or tracked labels into a reusable typography role.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Shared Edge Rule",
        "body": "Align headers, filters, rows and panels to the working-sheet gutter, and contain each wide region within that sheet.",
        "section": "layout"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Flat Working Sheet Rule",
        "body": "Organize static work with edges and spacing; use lift only to explain a floating or overlapping tool.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** use live semantic CSS properties and verify both themes.",
      "**Do** preserve configured branding, campaign context and established role terminology.",
      "**Do** use neutral actions with restrained magenta focus and selection.",
      "**Do** retain 44px targets, visible focus and readable sentence-case field labels.",
      "**Do** align content to the working-sheet gutter and retain the 160px bottom runway.",
      "**Do** contain wide tables and tabs within their own scroll regions.",
      "**Do** distinguish observed snapshots, stale data, connection states and delivery results honestly.",
      "**Do** preserve stateful call/form roots and persisted widget layouts."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** restore glass, gradients, glow or decorative card lift to the operational sheet.",
      "**Don't** introduce a separate visual language for individual admin pages.",
      "**Don't** reuse tiny metadata, decorative kickers or tracked uppercase copy as a new typography standard.",
      "**Don't** use status colors without an accompanying label, icon or structure.",
      "**Don't** hide critical controls behind hover or create page-level horizontal overflow.",
      "**Don't** replace configured organization identity with a hard-coded product name.",
      "**Don't** apply these scoped workspace rules to overwrite the existing public landing composition.",
      "**Don't** add animation that ignores reduced-motion preference."
    ]
  }
}
